![SystemVerilog](https://img.shields.io/badge/SystemVerilog-RTL-blue)
![OpenLane](https://img.shields.io/badge/OpenLane-2.0-green)
![Sky130](https://img.shields.io/badge/Sky130-PDK-orange)
![ASIC](https://img.shields.io/badge/ASIC-RTL_to_GDSII-red)

---

## Project Overview

This project implements an **Ethernet RX Gateway ASIC** using **SystemVerilog** and the **OpenLane 2 RTL-to-GDSII flow** with the **Sky130 PDK**.

The design receives Ethernet frames through an RMII interface, parses Ethernet packets, buffers incoming data, and forwards valid packets to the gateway interface.

---

# System Architecture

![Architecture](docs/images/architecture.png)

---

# RTL Modules

- RMII Receiver
- Ethernet Frame Parser
- Packet Buffer
- Sync FIFO
- Ethernet RX Path
- Gateway Core

