n-friendly fabrics and footwear for daily wear, without assuming my budget or city.\",\"title\":\"Choose monsoon-friendly fabric\"},{\"body\":\"Find a current Indian regional trailer that suits a light film night, then suggest a no-spoiler watch plan.\",\"title\":\"Try a regional film night\"},{\"title\":\"Draft a society notice\",\"body\":\"Draft a polite apartment-society notice for a water cut. Ask me the date and duration first, then write group-message and notice-board versions.\"},{\"title\":\"Make a tiffin idea wheel\",\"body\":\"Create a text-light tiffin idea wheel with simple food icons and blank labels. Ask my main flavour preference first.\"},{\"title\":\"Prep for Passport Seva\",\"body\":\"Help me prepare for a Passport Seva appointment. Ask which service it is, then make an official-doc checklist and visit-day plan.\"},{\"title\":\"Draw your budget buckets\",\"body\":\"Create a simple budget bucket diagram with generic icons and three blank labels. Keep any written guidance outside the image.\"},{\"body\":\"Use a recent India ODI scorecard to teach me how a chase is paced: powerplay, middle overs, required run rate and wickets.\",\"title\":\"Understand an ODI chase\"},{\"title\":\"Sort ITR papers before filing\",\"body\":\"Help me make an ITR document folder for AY 2026-27. Ask only my income type first, then list likely documents to collect.\"},{\"title\":\"Sort my paperwork pile\",\"body\":\"Help me sort a pile of bills, forms and notes. Ask what categories I see, then give me a quick filing plan.\"},{\"body\":\"Explain the 48-team World Cup format like I’m joining a group chat late, with a tiny glossary and a playful example.\",\"title\":\"Explain the 48-team chaos\"},{\"body\":\"Explain five T20 cricket terms I’ll hear during India Women’s matches, with examples from the current World Cup.\",\"title\":\"Learn women’s T20 terms\"},{\"title\":\"Choose a Reel soundtrack\",\"body\":\"Find a current Indian music trend for a short video idea. Ask what the video is about, then suggest a clean hook and caption.\"},{\"title\":\"Draw a UPI payment flow\",\"body\":\"Create a text-light doodle showing when to use cash, UPI Lite or normal UPI. Check current rules first.\"}]},\"is_device_based\":true,\"passed\":true},\"3701585807\":{\"name\":\"3701585807\",\"rule_id\":\"4V4CgF1TPMJrczjAfIZIOn:100.00:6-4V4CgDmRnuzWT9LEEB45vl\",\"secondary_exposures\":[],\"version\":13,\"id_type\":\"userID\",\"value\":{\"categories\":[{\"name\":\"Shopping\",\"id\":\"SHOPPING\"},{\"name\":\"Food\",\"id\":\"FOOD\"},{\"id\":\"ENTERTAINMENT\",\"name\":\"Entertainment\"},{\"id\":\"EDUCATION\",\"name\":\"Education\"},{\"name\":\"Design\",\"id\":\"DESIGN\"},{\"name\":\"Business\",\"id\":\"BUSINESS\"},{\"name\":\"Developer Tools\",\"id\":\"DEVELOPER_TOOLS\"},{\"id\":\"PRODUCTIVITY\",\"name\":\"Productivity\"},{\"id\":\"COLLABORATION\",\"name\":\"Collaboration\"},{\"name\":\"Finance\",\"id\":\"FINANCE\"},{\"id\":\"TRAVEL\",\"name\":\"Travel\"},{\"name\":\"Lifestyle\",\"id\":\"LIFESTYLE\"}],\"buckets\":[{\"id\":\"lifestyle\",\"categories\":[\"SHOPPING\",\"FOOD\",\"ENTERTAINMENT\",\"TRAVEL\",\"LIFESTYLE\",\"NEWS\"],\"name\":\"Lifestyle\"},{\"id\":\"productivity\",\"name\":\"Productivity\",\"categories\":[\"EDUCATION\",\"DESIGN\",\"BUSINESS\",\"DEVELOPER_TOOLS\",\"PRODUCTIVITY\",\"COLLABORATION\",\"FINANCE\"]}]},\"is_device_based\":false,\"passed\":true},\"3792512848\":{\"name\":\"3792512848\",\"rule_id\":\"default\",\"secondary_exposures\":[],\"version\":12,\"id_type\":\"userID\",\"value\":{\"payment_method_instrumentation_type\":{\"paypal\":\"full_redirect\",\"pix\":\"partial_redirect\"}},\"is_device_based\":false,\"passed\":false},\"371023604\":{\"name\":\"371023604\",\"rule_id\":\"default\",\"secondary_exposures\":[],\"version\":18,\"id_type\":\"userID\",\"value\":{\"controls\":{\"connector_2128aebfecb84f64a069897515042a44\":{\"gmail_recipient_domains\":{\"display_in_ui\":true,\"enforce\":true},\"email_recipient_domains\":{\"display_in_ui\":true,\"e